{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果公司正式推出首款搭載觸控屏的MacBook Pro。這款新品同時配備PROLED XDR顯示屏以及全新的靈動島，不再採用傳統的劉海屏形態，定價為22999元起。<strong>在MacBook Pro發佈之後，多名博主在社交平台上分享了蘋果創始人喬布斯在發佈會上的一段演講。2010年，喬布斯曾在發佈會公開反對把觸控屏搬上筆記本。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/movie/1584290.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:02:22.862884+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T06:45:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T06:58:55.750399+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T06:58:55.750399+00:00","content_hash":"cee091796cc8080634f5db083db2af8032aa600b427178ccb61e9b6e0e1c9efe","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}